repository-code: https://github.com/V-Sekai-fire/interactor-a2a
abstract: >-
  An Agent2Agent (A2A) v1.0 server library in Lean 4. An agent is a name, a list
  of skills and a function from the text of a message to the text of a reply; the
  library supplies the Agent Card, JSON-RPC 2.0, the A2A error codes and an
  HTTP/1.1 server with bearer-token and browser-origin checks, all testable as
  pure functions.
